---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import {site,communityLinks} from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Community"><div class="page-shell"><PageHeading eyebrow="Better together" title="Find your people." description="Players, mapmakers, translators and curious contributors: there’s room for you in Glob2."/><div class="two-grid">{communityLinks.map(link=><a class="card" href={link.url}><h2>{link.title}</h2><p>{link.description}</p><span class="text-link">Explore ↗</span></a>)}<a class="card" href={site.mapsUrl}><h2>Share and play maps</h2><p>Browse player-made maps in the online app, and upload your own once you’ve signed in.</p><span class="text-link">Browse maps ↗</span></a><article class="card"><h2>Discord</h2>{site.discordUrl?<><p>Meet other players and help shape the project.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.discordUrl}>Join Discord ↗</a></>:<p>A verified invitation will be published here when the community server is ready. Use the project’s public discussion channels in the meantime.</p>}</article></div><section class="prose section-space"><h2>A good place to play</h2><p>Welcome new players. Keep discussion respectful, share strategies generously, and give opponents a fair match. Report bugs with enough detail for someone else to reproduce them.</p><h2>Help build the next chapter</h2><p>Code, artwork, mapmaking, translations and clear explanations all make a difference. Start with the contribution information in the project repository.</p><a href={site.sourceUrl}>Visit the Globulation 2 repository ↗</a></section></div></Base>
